---
title: Circular avatar previews keep a square crop
date: '2026-10-04'
tags:
  - fixed
summary: Circular avatar previews now clip a square image rather than rounding a rectangular image box.
---
<script>
  import ThemedShot from '$lib/components/changelog/ThemedShot.svelte';
</script>

The circular preview in [Brand assets](/brand?view=list) now uses a square, centered crop for logos and avatars across grid, list, and journey views. Previously, the list thumbnail box was wider than it was tall, so rounded corners did not produce a circular image.

Turning the preview off restores the full image at its original proportions. Banners remain uncropped.

